  (sid, eng_id, 'mcq', 'In the poem "Quality of Mercy", it is said that "mercy is above this sceptred sway" because:', '[{"key": "A", "value": "mercy is a weakness that undermines a king''s power", "correct": false}, {"key": "B", "value": "mercy is more powerful and valuable than temporary earthly authority", "correct": true}, {"key": "C", "value": "a king cannot rule without instilling constant dread", "correct": false}, {"key": "D", "value": "crowns and sceptres are easily lost in battles", "correct": false}]', 'B', 1, 'medium', '["Quality of Mercy"]', '["comprehension"]', true),
  (sid, eng_id, 'mcq', 'In the lines describing the sceptre, the word "temporal" means something that is:', '[{"key": "A", "value": "Related to religious or sacred practices", "correct": false}, {"key": "B", "value": "Lasting forever; eternal", "correct": false}, {"key": "C", "value": "Relating to worldly, material, or limited time", "correct": true}, {"key": "D", "value": "Calculated or strictly measured", "correct": false}]', 'C', 1, 'easy', '["Quality of Mercy"]', '["vocabulary"]', true),
  (sid, eng_id, 'mcq', 'Based on the poem "Quality of Mercy", the statement that best captures the contrast intended by the author is:', '[{"key": "A", "value": "A king is only respected when he wears his crown.", "correct": false}, {"key": "B", "value": "Earthly symbols of power command fear, while mercy stands on a higher ground.", "correct": true}, {"key": "C", "value": "True monarchs should discard their sceptres to prove they are merciful.", "correct": false}, {"key": "D", "value": "Fear is a better attribute for a ruler than mercy.", "correct": false}]', 'B', 1, 'medium', '["Quality of Mercy"]', '["comprehension"]', true),
  (sid, eng_id, 'mcq', 'According to the given lines, mercy descends upon the earth:', '[{"key": "A", "value": "Like a sudden, destructive storm", "correct": false}, {"key": "B", "value": "Like a gentle rain falling from heaven", "correct": true}, {"key": "C", "value": "Through force and strict laws", "correct": false}, {"key": "D", "value": "As a heavy burden on the people", "correct": false}]', 'B', 1, 'easy', '["Quality of Mercy"]', '["comprehension"]', true),
